WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.880
<v Narrator><i>The crew hears Charybdis roar and sees spray rising from the whirlpool.</i>

2
00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:25.690
<v Odysseus>Row, friends — we have been in worse and lived, and this too we shall remember. Helmsman, hold her off that smoke and hug the cliff — keep to the rock, or you kill us all.

3
00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:34.260
<v Narrator><i>Odysseus arms himself despite Circe's warning and searches the rock face.</i>

4
00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:42.550
<v Narrator><i>Scylla's six heads strike, lifting six screaming men from the ship.</i>

5
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:53.320
<v Narrator><i>The survivors pass beyond both monsters while watching their companions die above them.</i>
